sz
------------------------------------------
Modular Error-bounded Lossy Compression Framework for Scientific Datasets

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libSZ3c3.4-3.4.0-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  libhdf5_320-2.2.0-1
  libhdf5sz3_3.4-3.4.0-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libzstd1-1.5.7-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  hdf5-2.2.0-1
  libaec-devel-1.1.8-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libhdf5-devel-2.2.0-1
  libzstd-devel-1.5.7-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/szcompressor/SZ3

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/szcompressor/SZ3/archive/refs/tags/v3.4.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack sz-3.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./sz-3.4.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/sz-3.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/sz-3.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/sz-devel-3.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libSZ3c3.4-3.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhdf5sz3_3.4-3.4.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

